        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Surgical removal of excess abdominal skin and fat and tightening of the ABDOMINAL WALL. Abdominoplasty may include LIPECTOMY of INTRA-ABDOMINAL FAT, tightening of the ABDOMINAL MUSCLES, and re-creation of the UMBILICUS. [Definition Source: MSH]</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Abdominoplasty</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


