        <dcterms:conformsTo>https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C1517194</dcterms:conformsTo>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Any relative who is one meiosis away from a particular individual in a family; a relative with whom one half of an individual&apos;s genes is shared (i.e., parent, sibling, offspring) (from Genetics Home Reference glossary) [Definition Source: NCI]</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">First Degree Relative</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


